     "kind": "dialogue",
     "speaker": "rickshaw-shop-owner",
     "alias": null,
     "inner": false,
     "text": "听听声儿吧，铃铛似的！你就是把车拉碎了，钢条软了一根，摔在我脸上！",
     "segs": [
      {
       "text": "听听声儿吧，铃铛似的！你就是把车拉碎了，钢条软了一根，摔在我脸上！",
       "marks": [],
       "speed": 1
      }
     ],
     "id": null,
     "cont": false,
     "line": 61,
     "step": 41
    },
    {
     "type": "line",
     "kind": "dialogue",
     "speaker": "rickshaw-shop-owner",
     "alias": null,
     "inner": false,
     "text": "一百块，少一分咱们吹！",
     "segs": [
      {
       "text": "一百块，少一分咱们吹！",
       "marks": [],
       "speed": 1
